{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object, check its properties and complete specific task. Avoid obstacles and scan for new objects.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    />",
